  m_text: 'Cars are <b>processes</b>, bays are <b>resources</b>. A car that holds
    a bay and asks for a taken one must <b>wait</b>. If the waits form a loop, no
    car can ever move: <color=#EF4444><b>deadlock</b></color>.'
